@startuml SEQ_01_LOGIN
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12\nskinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-01: Login

actor       "Publik"                         as Publik
boundary    "Browser"                        as Browser
control     "AuthenticatedSessionController" as Controller
entity      "User Model"                     as Model
database    "users"                          as DB

== Buka Halaman Login ==

Publik  -> Browser     : Akses /login
Browser -> Controller  : GET /login
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman login
Browser --> Publik     : Tampil form login

== Login ==

Publik  -> Browser     : Isi email + password, klik Login
Browser -> Controller  : POST /login {email, password}
Controller -> Model    : Auth::attempt({email, password})
Model -> DB            : SELECT users WHERE email = ?
DB --> Model           : Data user
Model --> Controller   : Hasil autentikasi

alt kredensial salah
  Controller --> Browser : Redirect back + pesan error login
  Browser --> Publik     : Tampil pesan error
else kredensial benar
  Controller --> Browser : Set session login + pesan sukses
  alt role praktikan
    Controller --> Browser : Redirect ke halaman Daftar Tugas Praktikan
    Browser --> Publik     : Masuk halaman Daftar Tugas Praktikan
  else role lainnya
    Controller --> Browser : Redirect ke halaman Dashboard
    Browser --> Publik     : Masuk halaman Dashboard
  end
end

@enduml
